. *------------------------------------------------------------------------------*
. * Native-side crowdout shock per occupation: standard 10-year lag for
. * 1910/1920/1930; 20-year lag for 1900 (since 1890 lacks occupation-level
. * labor force data).
. *------------------------------------------------------------------------------*
. 
. xtset countynhg_1930 year

Panel variable: countynhg_1930 (unbalanced)
 Time variable: year, 1880 to 1930, but with gaps
         Delta: 1 unit

. 
. foreach o of local occs {
  2. 
. gen crowdout_euall_nat_occ`o' = (euro_imm_occ`o'_10yr_US_lvout / euro_imm_lf_10yr_US_lvout) * (l10.nat_occ`o' / l10.
> nat_lf_tot)
  3. replace crowdout_euall_nat_occ`o' = (euro_imm_occ`o'_10yr_US_lvout / euro_imm_lf_10yr_US_lvout) * (l20.nat_occ`o'
>  / l20.nat_lf_tot) if year == 1900
  4. 
. }
